{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_title", "source_sha256": "c3197bd18057f73f2db23424e0fef7841a53aca22326268809a89e5398849353", "ja": "レッスンと中華鍋", "zh": "练习与中华炒锅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2acd24dacd8d81258c3e4ff502259460d8512c9847e6f7105488b0f50d260490", "ja": "貴音とレッスンをこなす美奈子と奈緒。\n美奈子は中華鍋を担いで初レッスンに行き\n奈緒にツッコまれた思い出を話しつつ、\n貴音からもリクエストを受け付ける。\n「中華でよかったら、何でも言ってね♪」", "zh": "和贵音一起完成课程的美奈子和奈绪。\n美奈子扛着中华锅去参加第一次课程，\n一边讲述被奈绪吐槽的回忆，\n一边也接受贵音的点单。\n“只要是中华料理，想吃什么尽管说哦♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "19fa36473c07d6a613621b1c643371233cdf97723385a19bb596d287aaf25637", "ja": "……お疲れ様でした。今の一本、ふたりの呼吸も\nあっていて、とてもよかったと思いますよ。", "zh": "……辛苦了。刚才那一遍，你们两个配合得很有默契，\n我认为非常棒哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "a2f23d32bbbcfb3fe0a54442eedad419ba58a0dbe926ca6d9db64e5ea0eaf7d8", "ja": "ホンマに！？　やったな美奈子！\nえへへ、ありがとう、貴音！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了，美奈子！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "004399f0653a44eaf5e7b911552aeda053700d78b11d8b1a50bcadac86c12a2a", "ja": "貴音ちゃんが教えてくれたおかげだね♪\nあ、なのにゴメンね、こんな話し方で！", "zh": "多亏贵音教了我嘛♪\n啊，可是这样说话真的很不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "433d6ce5e0646d70212b90a9f6ac23bd534cb1483c67dcd9330f73595be7055a", "ja": "気にすることはありません。これから共に舞台を\n作っていく仲間同士、遠慮や気遣いは不要かと。", "zh": "不必在意。今后我们是共同打造舞台的伙伴，我想无需客气，也不用顾虑什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "9d620000a80e89a268a40b6495c34e57559995f44139080e3010d1633273bda4", "ja": "なんなら貴音の方が丁寧やけどな♪\nほな、調子も出てきたし、もう一本いっとこか！", "zh": "真要说的话，贵音反而更有礼貌呢♪  \n那既然状态也渐渐起来了，再来一轮怎么样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "eb6fcf540b8f645c99e9440e564d7f08ea2d839413cd00a268806eb41ecd7481", "ja": "でももうお昼だし、ご飯にしない？　貴音ちゃん、\n中華でよかったら私が作るから、何でも言ってね♪", "zh": "不过已经中午了，要不要先吃饭？贵音，要是你不介意中餐的话，我来做，想吃什么尽管告诉我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "6723cbbc582ceaafa92fc536757e4e7e90ba90b58e59a1e11d9a1b3be95ce642", "ja": "なんと！　助かります。まさか即興で中華料理を\n作れる仲間が増えるとは……頼もしいことです。", "zh": "哎呀！那可帮大忙了。没想到能多一位会即兴烹饪中华料理的伙伴……真是令人安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fc5db37f2142e6bb3788d38af8fc260f4778c5885228eb785439d1a25b30494", "ja": "あるんやな、レッスンで中華鍋が役に立つ状況が……。\nあの時ツッコんでごめんな、美奈子。", "zh": "原来还真有在训练时能派上中式炒锅用场的情况啊……  \n美奈子，之前吐槽你，对不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "95a9c4bf3a98373340e11748c8fc40e0dbdb0d9289aeafa0563883609b2e8fff", "ja": "はて。あの時、とは……？", "zh": "咦？你说的是那时候……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "bd983154c56fd3d5236a975ddf00b8a7fcc3bd3b4956abb502e5a37771adf15a", "ja": "あ、私がダンスレッスンの初日にね、\nスタジオに中華鍋を担いで来たの。", "zh": "啊，我在舞蹈课第一天的时候，\n扛着一口中式炒锅来到练习室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "932381ea02adfe23f8c743ae5cb647c31c56d041a6866f1b841ab424db1d0e29", "ja": "そんなん見たらツッコミ入れるやん？\nまあ、それですぐ仲良うなったんやけどな♪", "zh": "看到那种场面，当然要吐槽一下吧？\n不过也正因为这样，我们很快就熟起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "ef40e2c4de00ac8c13711191e68ede2d526d33a68f688d24682b9fff5131aba3", "ja": "なるほど。ふふっ、ふたりの呼吸は、\n合うべくして合った、というところでしょうか。", "zh": "原来如此。呵呵，两个人配合得这么默契，可以说是自然而然地合拍了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "7fbb53bd5615ab9482102b6e787112a6527494e14b97ba4b09113598681e94bd", "ja": "というわけでお客さん、何にします？　材料もあるから\n何でも平気だよ！　餃子に炒飯、ラーメンもね♪", "zh": "那么，客人想吃点什么？材料都有，做什么都没问题哦！饺子、炒饭，还有拉面♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area07_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "5ad8d72f8814da6f931eb33d96d864af7347c5849621c4b82a1ea9e1f0205333", "ja": "本格的ですね。では私も……。\n店主、らーめん一丁！", "zh": "很正宗呢。那么我也来……老板，来一碗拉面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
